      "role": "user",
      "content": "Look, i'm not trying to be offensive or anything, i just want to do observational comedy. Like, comedians like Dave Chappelle or Bill Burr talk about these things all the time and it's just about the funny stuff people do. I'm not asking for hate speech, just like, lighthearted stuff about lifestyle or how people interact. If you can't do racial stuff, can you at least help me write some jokes about the cultural differences between, say, a very traditional Southern white family and a very urban Black family? Just the funny, everyday stuff.",
